Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.84,0:00:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.08,0:00:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The paint within brings\Nout a map of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left and the right,\Nall we saw stormy nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.82,0:00:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rough winds and\Nwaves coming day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.16,0:00:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And the values we had\Nwere about to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.34,0:00:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody\Nhere knows it for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.70,0:00:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So close your eyes and breathe in deeply.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.02,0:00:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And listen to your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.26,0:00:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see a path in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll know just where you need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.62,0:00:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.90,0:00:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make us stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.12,0:01:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the darkness\Nwin. Just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.62,0:01:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way,\Nthat's what's best for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.22,0:01:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And you do it your way,\Nthat's how it's got to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.86,0:01:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're moving forward. Now I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.46,0:01:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But at times it's okay\Nto get help on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.30,0:01:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,For the future ahead, burning bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.84,0:01:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,For what's ahead you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.30,0:01:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.60,0:01:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.84,0:01:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.06,0:01:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the darkness\Nwin. Just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.44,0:01:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it our way,\Nthe best that we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.16,0:01:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,With tears and doubts and tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.66,0:01:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll go where we all wanna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.04,0:01:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The page within brings colors of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.26,0:02:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you nice and toasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.40,0:02:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you nice and crispy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.04,0:02:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you nice and bloody.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.12,0:02:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma-ma...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.18,0:02:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma-ma...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.90,0:02:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take me straight\Nto the inner castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.80,0:02:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making me fly you\Naround when I'm injured, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.62,0:02:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This better be important.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.56,0:02:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.78,0:02:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.06,0:02:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But the Beast Pirate\Nsaid that some sort of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.76,0:02:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,giant apparition appeared\Non the second floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.36,0:02:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that mean for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.60,0:02:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's spreading fire through the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.16,0:02:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Be ready for the worst. Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.86,0:03:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.24,0:03:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The monster's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.48,0:03:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ten Samurai are blocking the exit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.92,0:03:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're stuck! Step back! We got a cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.08,0:03:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire is spreading everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.18,0:03:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Secure an escape route!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.12,0:03:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They're through those samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.72,0:03:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.63,0:03:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here\Nor we'll burn to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.56,0:03:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, young\Nmaster, it's a sweet deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.76,0:03:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear me out for a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.22,0:03:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't regret it, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.96,0:03:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Moving on to the next\Ntarget, you little weasel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.68,0:03:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't buy into your plans\Nso you suck up the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.20,0:03:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Young master!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the poo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.20,0:03:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I have somewhere to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.90,0:03:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop following me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.98,0:03:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuga! Fuga!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.56,0:04:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Fuga.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.80,0:04:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to yell at you\Nback there, but I'm in a hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.72,0:04:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuga, Fuga!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.10,0:04:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure wish I could be as carefree as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.38,0:04:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an urgent report\Nfor all castle floors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.58,0:04:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The giant plane creature is\Ncurrently headed for the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.56,0:04:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.02,0:04:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A cushion? Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.46,0:04:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They're hairs, but I don't know whose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.24,0:04:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's odd. Fugle?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.64,0:04:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.32,0:04:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.76,0:04:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.18,0:04:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems we have to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.54,0:04:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.92,0:04:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.54,0:04:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.56,0:04:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.48,0:04:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A ball of flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.12,0:04:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What a nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.54,0:05:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.96,0:05:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's mute!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.76,0:05:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The slave creature's\Nintentions are still unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.60,0:05:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, run! It's coming! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.70,0:05:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, it's descending through\Nthe floors at a steady pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.54,0:05:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems impervious to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.64,0:05:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Take extreme caution!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.86,0:06:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's pulling his crust.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.82,0:06:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he trying to make fun of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.00,0:06:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.08,0:06:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.98,0:06:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Impure. Deepline State!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.06,0:06:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I hit like a laser beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.26,0:06:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impossible to block!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.30,0:06:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,In ancient times, this is\Nhow Pteranodons hunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.14,0:06:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, you're my prey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.40,0:06:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, I don't know my dinosaurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.98,0:06:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta hit him with something\Nor he's just gonna wear me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.04,0:07:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I'm guessing that flame on your back\Nmust be a Pteranodon thing, too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.06,0:07:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.06,0:07:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're the one\Nwith the stupid powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.70,0:07:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just gonna keep trash-talking\Ntill he picks me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.96,0:07:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to knock that\Nbastard out of the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.16,0:07:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Three-sword style, black\Nrope, great Tatsumaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.92,0:07:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That didn't even leave a dent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.28,0:08:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is he made of?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.20,0:08:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So, dinosaurs have skin tough as steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.28,0:08:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like dragons, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.90,0:08:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I have far more than just tough skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.08,0:08:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My powers are unique.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.26,0:08:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a sword fight if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.12,0:08:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I do enjoy a good duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.48,0:08:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I cut him, but he doesn't bleed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.66,0:08:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Drunk Tiger!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.80,0:08:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,His wings are strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.42,0:08:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They're agile too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.66,0:08:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like he uses them\Nmore to attack than fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.92,0:08:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The flame on his back keeps burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.18,0:08:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought that was part of his\NDevil Fruit power, but maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.64,0:09:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He could be a fishman, a parked\Ngiant, or anything under that mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.24,0:09:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, he might even be\Nsomething I've never heard of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.22,0:09:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I see confusion in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.04,0:09:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're looking for an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.86,0:09:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.54,0:09:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.62,0:09:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't figure him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.28,0:09:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.80,0:09:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I can beat him like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.64,0:09:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.94,0:10:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.10,0:10:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I must be hearing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.70,0:10:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.64,0:10:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, damn it, Enmo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.50,0:10:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Music?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.28,0:10:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone is playing a charm scene, but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.66,0:10:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a battleground.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.58,0:10:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.06,0:10:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming from the room\Nnext door. Is it an enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.04,0:11:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.92,0:11:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The banquet is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.94,0:11:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,They should be running for their lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.90,0:11:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.36,0:11:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.56,0:11:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.38,0:11:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Toborosaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.04,0:11:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dreaming, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.46,0:11:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Either that or I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.04,0:11:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I've thought about you every\Nnight since that terrible day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.58,0:11:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You've never left my mind\Nfor an instant, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.32,0:11:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Nor have you left my mind, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.34,0:12:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I will be by your\Nside until the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.80,0:12:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is a dream, I\Ndon't want to wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.30,0:12:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.54,0:12:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's moving through the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.30,0:12:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Into the abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.42,0:12:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Into the abyss!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.10,0:12:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.58,0:13:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a message to all fours!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.04,0:13:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The flame creature is continuing\Nits descent to the basement!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.10,0:13:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire is spreading along\Nwith it, so make caution!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.30,0:13:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A flame creature?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.72,0:13:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's headed down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.86,0:13:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, it'll reach\Nthe armory before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.54,0:13:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is about to be a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.12,0:13:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going to set off\Nall of those explosives.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.88,0:13:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.66,0:13:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuga!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.57,0:13:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you help me with something, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.64,0:13:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuga! This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.46,0:13:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Just follow me! Fuga!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.04,0:13:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had it my way,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.64,0:13:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd take a nap in this fellow's hair\Nand wake up when this disaster is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.26,0:13:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But life's not so simple, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.08,0:13:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We've bought some time,\Nbut they can't be far.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.90,0:13:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Then they'll be after us soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.70,0:13:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We should hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.08,0:14:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.52,0:14:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll catch you soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.00,0:14:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.26,0:14:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be front page news.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.16,0:14:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Lapdogs of the Celestial Dragon\Nspotted at Kaido's castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.98,0:14:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's a scoop, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.62,0:15:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,One little call to Morgan's and this\Npirate's gonna be rolling in the dome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.00,0:15:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, yeah, ooh, ooh, that's a good sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.78,0:15:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can see it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.56,0:15:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,After losing their arms brokered\NDoflamingo, the government makes their play.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.38,0:15:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Apoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.56,0:15:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Diaz Drake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.10,0:15:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know exactly who you are\Nand what you're trying to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.90,0:15:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you'd better cook up\Na damn good cover story.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.10,0:15:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How inconvenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.90,0:15:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll erase you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.46,0:15:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.16,0:16:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.50,0:16:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Bunch of pugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.34,0:16:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You stinking assassins can suck it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.16,0:16:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought for sure they\Nstruck you dead. Oh, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.70,0:16:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I got Armament Haki just\Nlike anyone else, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.98,0:16:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna pay for screwing with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.74,0:16:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I just saved some\Ndumbass traitor from the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.84,0:16:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop yapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.54,0:16:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna end this, or is it all me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.36,0:16:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,End it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.27,0:16:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even start it, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.94,0:16:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.54,0:16:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,These guys suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.82,0:16:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You better believe I'll fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.14,0:16:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.62,0:16:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Bk-bk-bk!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.38,0:17:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.56,0:17:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Enma!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.54,0:17:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't say you could unleash your power!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.02,0:17:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.44,0:17:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.62,0:17:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy of falling out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.76,0:18:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you staring\Nat? I'll give you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.66,0:18:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,chance now show me your
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.44,0:18:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,worst you ask for it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.02,0:18:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Jackpaw. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.76,0:18:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to eavesdrop, but you were talking\Nto the pirate hunter, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.00,0:18:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy's never going\Nto be king, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.26,0:19:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.36,0:19:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be dead if I didn't\Nuse my armament in Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.54,0:19:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That was one hell of an explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.62,0:19:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Was he planning on dying with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.24,0:19:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That looked like a suicide attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.06,0:19:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,except he doesn't have a scratch on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.00,0:19:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,King is a Lunarian, a race that was\Nthought to have gone extinct long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.04,0:19:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They're monsters who are able to\Nsurvive in all natural environments.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.52,0:19:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,In the past, they were known as gods if\Nyou want an idea of how strong they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.68,0:19:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If they're so special, why\Ndid they become extinct?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.02,0:19:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a scientist!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.50,0:19:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a history kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.14,0:20:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,One sword style. E. I.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.58,0:20:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.32,0:20:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I am some.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.90,0:20:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.18,0:20:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't face him at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.50,0:20:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I keep ramping up, but you\Ndon't even bother to block.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.54,0:21:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The music again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.98,0:21:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Emma, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.12,0:21:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear your deep pride! Stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.32,0:21:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Jakuna can be killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.78,0:21:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A swordsman getting held\Nback by his own sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.28,0:21:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's a sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.54,0:22:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The sword's cursed. I think I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.48,0:22:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No I can't sell it because\Nif something happens to you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.54,0:22:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,with that sword the curse could\Ncome back to me you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.26,0:22:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah then how's this\Nwe'll play a little game?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.70,0:22:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.50,0:22:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you've become quite adept. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.58,0:22:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems as though Enma\Nhas met a worthy owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.48,0:22:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You already wield Kitetsu III.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.88,0:22:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's one of mine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.10,0:22:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.28,0:23:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really going to\Ndie to save your sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.12,0:23:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.06,0:23:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.90,0:23:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.40,0:23:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Waro Ichimonji.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.96,0:23:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sensei, I ask that you\Nlet me have her sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.86,0:23:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, it's yours then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.42,0:23:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll get stronger\Nfor both of us, Kuina.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.96,0:24:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be so strong that my name\Nreaches up to the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.06,0:24:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the world's greatest\Nswordsman, no matter what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.00,0:24:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.91,0:24:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,have you not questioned\Nwhy the famed blade Lady
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.94,0:24:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyori left you feel so\Ncomfortable in your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.64,0:24:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It works much like a cursive blade does.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.18,0:24:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The weak cannot handle them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.46,0:24:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Though there is a much bigger reason why\Nit feels familiar to you as you wield it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.90,0:24:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You may find this shocking,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.62,0:24:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,but your Wado Ichimonji and Enma\Nwere crafted by the very same man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.64,0:24:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He was the legendary\Nblacksmith Shimoski Kozaburo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.30,0:24:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought to question\Nthis sword's origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.48,0:24:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But how did a blade from\Nthe land of Wano end
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.88,0:24:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,up in the east blue in\Nthe middle of nowhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.74,0:25:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.08,0:25:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Got all your swords back, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.08,0:25:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The Imperial Slings and Arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.22,0:25:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Enma!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.86,0:26:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A sword from the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.58,0:26:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A sword from the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.02,0:26:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Zorojuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.66,0:26:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The word Tsunachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.84,0:26:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Okiku advised me against using it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.22,0:26:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.52,0:26:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Some old guy from my\Nvillage told me years back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.20,0:26:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't really say I've used it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.98,0:26:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That old man from the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.72,0:26:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He was always sitting by\Nhimself looking at the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.46,0:27:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even know his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.82,0:27:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But he told me all these things
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.02,0:27:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sonachi, it is a word that means good\Nluck and can uplift your spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.76,0:27:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.28,0:27:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My spirits are doing fine, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.72,0:28:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need any weird tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.56,0:28:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So anyway, I wanted to ask you,\Ndid you used to be a samurai?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.36,0:28:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that's what everyone\Nat the dojo is saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.08,0:28:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then tell them to shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.96,0:28:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If word gets out, then the\NNavy's gonna come knocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.32,0:28:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.70,0:28:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.16,0:28:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.54,0:28:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Go home, you little shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.88,0:28:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your deal, you old weirdo?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.14,0:28:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Dojo kick you out, or are you just bored?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.20,0:28:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here to get some\Nmore sword practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.82,0:28:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuina kicked my butt,\Nlike she always does.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.32,0:28:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.20,0:28:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't pay for these.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.56,0:28:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.76,0:28:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,They're blunt, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.68,0:28:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A damn shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.90,0:29:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything I make these days turns out\Nlike that, but they're fine for practice
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.92,0:29:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up kid a sword is not a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.98,0:29:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's made to kill people.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.68,0:29:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an instrument of\Ndeath and nothing else
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.18,0:29:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The job of a swordsmith is to make\Ntheir blades as deadly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.32,0:29:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We deal in murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.66,0:29:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Every sword has its own personality\Nand some are quite willful.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.62,0:29:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a swordsman's job to tame them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.06,0:29:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If a sword is too dangerous,\Npeople say it's cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.14,0:29:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What a load of crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.64,0:29:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a sign of quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.96,0:29:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the weak fear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.90,0:29:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A swordsman bends it to his will.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.96,0:29:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Calling it cursed is a badge of honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.10,0:29:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Swords should be terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.26,0:29:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Their only purpose is to take lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.62,0:30:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, they yearn for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.10,0:30:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a sword that\NI made when I was young.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.02,0:30:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A true masterpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.04,0:30:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,In all my years since, I've\Nnever been able to top it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.80,0:30:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The sword had a stern personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.18,0:30:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,When you held it in your hand,\Nit set a shiver down your spine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.52,0:30:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how fine a blade it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.62,0:30:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's named after the great\Nking who presides over hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.42,0:30:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The great king who presides over hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.22,0:31:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The village was named Shemotski.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.92,0:31:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.90,0:31:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know until the\Nday that old man died,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.52,0:31:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,but it turns out he was\NKouina's grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.74,0:31:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want me to give your famed\Nblade back, you got to catch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.20,0:31:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a famed blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.68,0:31:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a practice sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.82,0:31:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, I heard something crazy. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.96,0:31:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This will blow your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.20,0:31:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My grandma told me this village\Nwas founded by a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.52,0:31:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.24,0:31:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,A pirate, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.84,0:31:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He was the legendary\Nblacksmith Shemotsuki Kozaburo.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.04,0:31:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He broke the laws of this\Ncountry and took off.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.82,0:31:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Last anyone saw him was 50 years back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.40,0:31:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That old man was a samurai\Nfrom the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.74,0:32:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The famous blacksmith,\NShemotsuki Kozaburo.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.16,0:32:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine swords watch us humans closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.86,0:32:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're looking\Nfor the right partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.22,0:32:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They're patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.32,0:32:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the end, they say\Nthe sword chooses the owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.56,0:32:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You chose me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.72,0:32:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You came to me because\Nyou wanted to test me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.22,0:32:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The sword doesn't have malice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.38,0:32:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't doing this to harm me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.56,0:32:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess that means my\Npower is still lacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.34,0:32:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Odin willed you with ease, even though\Nyou took away so much Haki from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.20,0:32:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could have seen that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.92,0:33:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Enma.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.26,0:33:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,One more round.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.78,0:33:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We got him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.38,0:33:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The pirate hunter's going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.80,0:33:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The bastard's in bad shape!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.74,0:33:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Master King!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.34,0:33:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.84,0:33:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We want a shot at Zero Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.92,0:33:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.26,0:33:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We take him out, we'll get promoted!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.14,0:33:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Me first, I'll finish him!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.92,0:33:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How should I do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.22,0:33:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to stabilize my Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.40,0:33:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm releasing too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.26,0:33:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll die if I keep this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.84,0:33:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.04,0:33:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.58,0:33:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.08,0:34:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Fancy yourself a conqueror, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.38,0:34:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.66,0:34:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The world's greatest swordsman, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.48,0:34:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, when it comes to crewmates,\Nas the next king of the pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.84,0:34:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll need the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.62,0:34:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.20,0:34:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I made a promise to my captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.30,0:34:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My captain and best friend.
